{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50584","headline":"酒名 · 员半千","name":"酒名","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帝乡从事隙，薄暮中山开。\n地域荆南记，人事豫北□。\n兰英{身虎}虹上。\n竹叶清风来。\n云物上可惜，落日顾霞杯。\n（见影印本《新编纂图增类要事林广记》卷七。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"员半千","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50584.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50584","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}